{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的音乐感受缺少 X 那种按乐句到时出现的细密变化，尤其在情绪转折和声音走向上，少了一层精确的同步体验。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分栏让人物叙事和音乐感受各有位置，完整的因果句也更容易让没读过原文的观众迅速明白人物为什么这样想、这样做。X 的关键词加亮和按时出现的感受更有音乐表现力，细腻程度也更高，但感受词有时过于密集，容易与正在听的音乐争夺注意力，短停留段尤其明显。综合实际观看体验，我会选 Y，虽然它牺牲了一部分音乐细节的精确性和情绪层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f550275-4226-451b-bcec-11942ccc5196", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T043135745283Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:33:04.761630+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eade357c9e2a0fe55131320c1f44722b4bee00ec9482c5c37472ca840d88076c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.